"entity": {
"name": "Friedrich Vorwerk Group SE",
"description": "Friedrich Vorwerk Group SE designs, creates and operates energy infrastructure. It operates through the following segments; Natural Gas, Electricity, Clean Hydrogen and Adjacent Opportunities. The Natural Gas segment involves the transportation and transformation of raw natural gas into conditioned natural gas. The Electricity segment is focused on the underground transportation and transformation of electricity produced from climate-friendly, non-fossil energy sources such as wind, solar, water and renewable raw materials. The Clean Hydrogen segment involves the transportation of energy produced from climate-friendly energy sources into clean hydrogen as well as its transportation to end users. The Adjacent Opportunities segment bundles all other projects and partial projects that do not fall into any of the above three segments but require related or similar technological approaches. The company was founded on October 02, 2019 and is headquartered in Tostedt, Germany.",
